th=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spider</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">900</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,300</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">378 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">300 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">78 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span>) + <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">44 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Summons\"><img alt=\"Summons\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Player_Summon_dc8280.gif\" width=\"11\"/></span></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-195× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-12× <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Arrow\">Poison Arrow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Plate%20Armor\">Plate Armor</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Plate%20Legs\">Plate Legs</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Two%20Handed%20Sword\">Two Handed Sword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Spider%20Silk\">Spider Silk</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Helmet\">Steel Helmet</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight%20Armor\">Knight Armor</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight%20Legs\">Knight Legs</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Time%20Ring\">Time Ring</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Lightning Headband (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Amulet\">Platinum Amulet</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Zevelon%20Duskbringer\"><img alt=\"Arachir the Ancient One\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Arachir_the_Ancient_One_d7d799.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Zevelon%20Duskbringer\">Zevelon Duskbringer</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">1,800</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,400</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">Around 1000</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-97× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li>0-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Skull%20%28Item%29\">Skull (Item)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Black%20Pearl\">Black Pearl</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ring%20of%20Healing\">Ring of Healing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Shield\">Vampire Shield</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Dreaded Cleaver (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Lord%20Token\">Vampire Lord Token</a> (always)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Note that the <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire\">vampires</a> only spawn together with <a href=\"#/wiki/Zevelon%20Duskbringer\">Zevelon Duskbringer</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-The_way_to_Hellgate\">The way to Hellgate</span></h2>\n<ul><li>First go to <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a>.</li>\n<li>Go down to lower level. (to the shops)</li>\n<li>Go down again at the little houses.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Way to Hellgate1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"190\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Way_to_Hellgate1_10c58f.png\" width=\"257\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>And go down again.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Way to Hellgate2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"127\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Way_to_Hellgate2_614695.png\" width=\"78\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>East of you is the Hellgate door but you need: <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203012\">Key 3012</a>.</li>\n<li>If you don't have follow the blue arrow.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Way to Hellgate3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"166\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Way_to_Hellgate3_c43103.png\" width=\"420\"/></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Exit\">Exit</span></h2>\n<p>Before you enter Hellgate make sure you know the way out, read <a href=\"#/wiki/Route%3AHellgate\">Route:Hellgate</a>.\n</p><p>A few things you might like to check out:\n</p><p>Hellgate Library/map - an almost complete map of the floor below the <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgate%20Library\">Hellgate Library</a> (Containing spawns)\n</p><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgate%20Library\">Hellgate Library</a> - some conversation with the bonelord NPC, and some books written in <a href=\"#/wiki/469\">469</a>, the Bonelord language\n<br/>\n</p><p>See also other Hunting Places.\n</p></div>","quests":["draconia-quest","realm-of-dreams-quest","secret-service-quest","shadows-of-yalahar-quest","the-explorer-society-quest","the-lightbearer","the-paradox-tower-quest","the-repenters-quest","the-roost-of-the-graveborn-quest","vampire-hunter-quest"]}